+ RULE_OPTION_TAI_HISTORICAL_DESC: "The §8Democratic Progressive Party§! wins the first transfer of power and the §8Kuomintang§! later returns, while Taiwan opens trade with the mainland and shifts its defense from the beaches toward survival and denial. The island remains a self-governing democracy that avoids both formal independence and unification."
+ RULE_OPTION_TAI_ACCOMMODATION: "Cross-Strait Accommodation"
+ RULE_OPTION_TAI_ACCOMMODATION_DESC: "The §8Kuomintang§! leads Taiwan into deep economic integration, confidence-building measures and talks on a peace framework with Beijing. Tension in the Strait falls while the mainland's leverage over the island grows."
+ RULE_OPTION_TAI_ISLAND_FORTRESS: "Island Fortress"
+ RULE_OPTION_TAI_ISLAND_FORTRESS_DESC: "Taiwan cuts its dependence on the mainland, stockpiles heavily, courts India and turns the island into a fortress. Beijing grows more alarmed even as coercion becomes far costlier for it."
